        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2e64db1638a24824ac63dc6207c7a4a0",
      "statement": "`web_search` runs after financial assessment on the success path, searches for external corroboration using the company name plus Companies House findings, records whether any tool was actually used as an audit-only groundedness signal, and persists the raw result together with redacted tool calls.",
